    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n3 Castlequarter, Clohamon Village, Bunclody, Co. Wexford\n\nSuperbly positioned on the Main Street of Clohamon Village, just a short 5-minute drive from Bunclody town centre, 1 Castlequarter offers a wonderful opportunity to acquire a modern and beautifully maintained home in a peaceful village setting.\nPresented in immaculate, turn-key condition throughout, this end-of-terrace property features a bright and well-proportioned layout designed for comfortable family living.\nAccommodation comprises of a welcoming entrance hallway, spacious living room, stylish kitchen and dining area, utility room, guest WC, three bedrooms, a modern ensuite, and a contemporary family bathroom.\nThe property benefits from on-street parking and rear access. The rear garden is fully concreted, offering a low-maintenance outdoor space ideal for everyday use."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 4.81m x 1.73m\nNeutrally decorated with laminate flooring.\n\nGuest WC - 1.47m x 1.73m\nNeatly presented and comprising a WC and wash-hand basin.\n\nLiving Room - 3.66m x 3.34m\nA bright and inviting reception room featuring an attractive fireplace with French doors opening through to the kitchen and creating a pleasant flow between the two living spaces.\n\nKitchen Dining Room - 4.24m x 3.34m\nBright and well-appointed kitchen with patio doors opening directly onto the rear garden.\n\nUtility Room - 1.52m x 1.73m\nA generously sized and practical utility room offering excellent additional storage and ample space for laundry appliances.\n\nLanding - 3.05m x 2.04m\nBright landing providing access to the first-floor accommodation, with a conveniently located hot press offering useful storage space.\n\nBathroom - 2.25m x 2.04m\nFinished with laminate flooring and comprising a bath with overhead shower, WC and wash-hand basin.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.66m x 3.03m\nA bright and well-proportioned bedroom featuring wood-effect flooring and a window overlooking the rear garden.\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.95m x 3.03m\nA bright, well-proportioned bedroom featuring carpeted flooring and a window overlooking the rear garden.\n\nEnsuite Bathroom - 1.39m x 1.96m\nComprising a shower enclosure, WC and wash-hand basin.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.50m x 2.37m\nA well-proportioned single bedroom featuring carpeted flooring and a window providing natural light.\n\n"
      },
      {
